flowchart TD
  P[prepare_context] --> R[route / select_skills]
  P -->|范围未决| U[await_input]
  R --> B[collect_baseline]
  B --> I[investigate: 三类专家]
  I --> V{validate_evidence}
  V -->|有限补查| I
  V -->|缺参或冲突| U[await_input]
  U -->|resume 后校验范围| P
  V -->|动作确认| A[await_approval]
  A -->|approve / reject| O[compose_outcome]
  V -->|证据充分或预算限制| O
  O --> F[finalize / Event / Outbox]
